    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NOTES ON A CONDITIONAL FORM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Notes on a Conditional Form is an album by The 1975, featuring a protest song with ambient music elements."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0050-7f83853dcbc3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THUNBERG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Thunberg is a lyricist for The 1975, delivering a spoken word performance on the album 'Notes on a Conditional Form'."</data>
